---
// src/components/conception/infoStandarStrategie.astro
---

<div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-24 items-center'>
  <div class='order-2 md:order-1'>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-2 gap-4'>
      <div
        class='bg-black/5 aspect-square flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 border-b-2 border-elite-accent'>
        <span class='text-3xl font-headline font-extrabold text-black uppercase'>100%</span>
        <span
          class='text-[9px] font-label uppercase tracking-widest text-elite-accent font-bold mt-2'
          >Discrétion</span
        >
      </div>
      <div
        class='bg-black/5 aspect-square flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 border-b-2 border-elite-accent'>
        <span class='text-3xl font-headline font-extrabold text-black uppercase'>24/7</span>
        <span
          class='text-[9px] font-label uppercase tracking-widest text-elite-accent font-bold mt-2'
          >Disponibilité</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class='order-1 md:order-2'>
    <span class='text-elite-accent font-label font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-[10px]'
      >Strategic Standard</span
    >
    <h2
      class='text-black font-headline text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold uppercase mt-4 tracking-tighter mb-8'>
      L'Expérience<br />Elite
    </h2>
    <p class='text-black/50 text-base leading-relaxed mb-12'>
      Nous comprenons que chaque trajet est une opportunité critique. Notre protocole d'excellence
      garantit une exécution sans faille pour vos enjeux de mobilité.
    </p>
    <div class='space-y-6'>
      <div class='flex items-start gap-4'>
        <span class='material-symbols-outlined text-elite-accent'>verified</span>
        <p class='text-black font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest'>
          Chauffeurs polyglottes & certifiés
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='flex items-start gap-4'>
        <span class='material-symbols-outlined text-elite-accent'>verified</span>
        <p class='text-black font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest'>
          Protocoles de sécurité VIP
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
